  (text "J1 Mini-Fit Jr 16P (odd pins left / even pins right):\n 1  BATT +12 V (fuse 5 A)\n 2  GND\n 3  lock, BLK/WHT (stock 6)\n 4  unlock, GRN/RED (stock 8)\n 5  trunk relay coil, GRN/BLU (stock 20)\n 6  horn relay, LT GRN/BLU (stock 18)\n 7  flasher relay coil, BLU/RED (stock 17)\n 8  ceiling light, BLK/WHT (stock 16)\n 9  RS-485 ground return (own wire, not shared with pin 2)\n10  trunk latch sw, ORN (stock 3)\n11  ignition ON, YEL/BLU (stock 11)\n12  key-in, BLU/WHT (stock 15)\n13  security LED cathode\n14  RS-485 A (twist with 15)\n15  RS-485 B (twist with 14)\n16  door open, BLK/YEL (stock 2)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 400 82 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fe4242c3-8322-4fca-aff3-202afa219b53"))
