  (text "J2 = stock connector, JAE IL-AG5-22P-D3L2 (green 22P, ETM view 55). Pin numbers are the FACTORY ones.\nRows are unequal: 1-10 outer, 11-22 inner (12 contacts). Same 16 nets as J1 — fit one connector, not both.\n 1  RS-485 A (stock: no terminal; twist with 12)\n 2  door open, BLK/YEL\n 3  trunk latch sw, ORN\n 4  hood open, YEL/RED — security only, not fitted\n 5  disarm switch, BLU — security only, not fitted\n 6  lock, BLK/WHT\n 7  unlock relay stage, YEL/RED — dropped at rev 8\n 8  unlock, GRN/RED\n 9  siren, RED — security only, not fitted\n10  BATT +12 V, WHT/BLU (fuse 5 A)\n11  ignition ON, YEL/BLU\n12  RS-485 B (stock: no terminal; twist with 1)\n13  GND, BLK\n14  security LED, RED (stock LED control)\n15  key-in, BLU/WHT\n16  ceiling light, BLK/WHT (~0.8 A)\n17  flasher relay coil, BLU/RED\n18  horn relay, LT GRN/BLU\n19  RS-485 ground return (stock: no terminal; own wire, not pin 13)\n20  trunk relay coil, GRN/BLU\n21  siren, WHT — security only, not fitted\n22  stock: no terminal — spare" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 440 332 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e51014fe-ac50-420a-99a1-0bb5aa938130"))
