  (text "Bring-up hardware. TP1-TP4 = +12V / +5V / SW / +3V3; TP5-TP7 = GND loops, one each at the buck,\nthe Pico and the harness end. J7 shorts RUN to GND for a hardware reset without cutting power.\nD40 = power good, D41 = heartbeat on GP15. JP1 selects the RS-485 terminator." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 325 375 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5616bc5c-fb4b-41b5-8962-2783ebd0e7d1"))
