  (wire (pts (xy 165.1 396.24) (xy 165.1 400.05)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "f2fd6c3b-c459-4f85-9d81-601a2db802b1"))
  (text "12 V -> 5 V buck, LM2678T-5.0 (260 kHz, integrated N-ch MOSFET, 45 V max input).\nFed from the protected rail: J1-1 -> D20 1N5822 -> RV20 1.5KE30A TVS -> C20 100uF 50V -> here.\nThe BOOST cap bootstraps the internal high-side gate above VIN - that is why an N-channel part needs it.\nFEEDBACK goes straight to +5V: the fixed -5.0 part has the divider inside, so there is none to get wrong.\nCatch diode must be a real Schottky rated >=2 A (SS34 or STPS5L60); a 1N5819 is 1 A and has no margin.\nKeep the SW loop physically tight: U3 pin 1 -> L1 -> C30 -> GND -> D30 -> back. That loop carries the switching current." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 45 425 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3034cfda-a267-4afe-a9e2-f52fc85e259f"))
  (no_connect (at 46.99 99.06) (uuid "0f7d35df-58f0-4e41-adeb-bde5b30a711d"))
