  (text "hondaPico — Pico W keyless-entry module, 2001 Honda Accord LX  (rev 8: stock functions only)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a86c395-cf8c-4edf-9c1a-33187573a82e"))
  (text "Scope: the stock keyless-entry feature set, nothing more. Remote start, the YEL/RED unlock-relay stage and their interlocks were removed in rev 8.\nOutputs: six ULN2803A ground-pulse channels (lock, unlock, trunk relay coil, flasher relay coil, horn relay coil, security LED)\nplus Q1 (harvested MTD3055VL) for the ceiling lamp. Every output line gets 2.2 nF + a P6KE30A TVS (cathode to the line, anode to GND):\nsame role as the Alpine board's V270 MOVs, but clamping at 41.4 V instead of 60 V, which the ULN2803A's 50 V rating needs.\nInputs are PC817 optos. Trunk and flasher relays are the car's own Mitsuba RC-2201s, back in their harness sockets. See circuits.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "607b62de-2477-4776-9fd9-fd1e59104f46"))
  (text "10k pulldowns: RP2040 GPIOs float until setup() runs; a floating ULN input can fire a channel at boot." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120 172 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c45382f3-b7d8-4da3-aef5-007fa3e46cee"))
  (text "ULN COM -> +12V enables the internal flyback diodes (relay coils ~105-125 mA each)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 200 60 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2911345b-421d-4d22-ba4b-84c1bdcb5e87"))
  (text "GROUND-ACTIVE inputs (TRUNK_AJAR = ORN, KEY_IN = BLU/WHT, DOOR = BLK/YEL): +5V -> 1k -> LED -> 1N5819 -> wire. Wire grounded => SENSE low.\n+12V-ACTIVE input (IGN = YEL/BLU): wire -> 1N5819 -> 2.2k -> LED -> GND. Wire at +12V => SENSE low.\nVSS removed at rev 8: with remote start gone its only use was speed auto-lock; the CM5 taps the cluster wire itself." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 335 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "33c9223c-c1b5-401e-9b5a-19ca6b04afbc"))
  (text "VBAT: 100k/22k -> 14.4 V reads 2.6 V (full scale 18 V). Also the engine-running detector." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 505 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "19a13489-caff-4e06-8dd5-45626d64099d"))
  (text "Pin budget after rev 8: 12 GPIOs used, 14 free. J1 has 3 spare pins.\nRemote start, if it returns, is its own module on the RS-485 bus." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 415 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1e795b20-5626-458a-b018-5a80e65458c1"))
